ou'll Do&#10;</b></div><div>&#8226;&#9;Systems &amp; Operations: Monitor cloud platforms (AWS, Snowflake), respond to incidents, support 24/7 mission-critical systems&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Data Engineering: Build ETL/ELT pipelines, move data between sources and warehouses, ensure data quality&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Quality Assurance: Write test cases, execute testing, validate data accuracy, automate test workflows&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Enterprise Applications: Configure Workday HCM modules, build reports, support integrations&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Automation: Identify repetitive tasks and automate using AI tools, scripts, and workflows&#10;</div><div><b>AI &amp; Innovation Focus&#10;</b></div><div>&#8226;&#9;Use Generative AI tools (AWS Bedrock, Claude, Amazon Q) for code generation and documentation&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Experiment with prompt engineering and AI-powered automation&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Learn and implement AI agents for testing and operational tasks&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Explore emerging technologies like Agentic AI frameworks&#10;</div><div><b>Learning &amp; Growth&#10;</b></div><div>&#8226;&#9;Work under mentorship of senior engineers on real production systems&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Participate in Agile teams and collaborate with data engineers, developers, and business analysts&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Document solutions and contribute to knowledge repositories&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Attend training sessions and work toward technical certifications&#10;</div><div>Technical Skills You Bring&#10;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Must Have:&#10;</b></div><div>&#8226;&#9;Programming: Solid Python or Java skills with basic understanding of object-oriented programming&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;SQL: Ability to write queries, joins, and understand data relationships&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Linux/Unix: Comfortable with command-line environments and basic shell scripting&#10;</div><div>&#8226;&#9;Problem-solving: Strong ana